 .
BLK=00003
BLKTYPE=GATETABL
MINDT=60.0 
PINIT=0.0
 CTLN UPSN DNSN TABN  DOM  AUX Lower gates for WDIT pumped LPR
  F28  F28  F32-9600  MAX  MAX
   -1
 .
 .
 .

This portion of the Operation Control Block input shows a negative 
table number, -9600.  This table looks like:

TABLE#= 9600
