1949  6 12  0.000000    9601.1           ' 9601 is the low-level control table for the dummy event.
1949  6 12  0.250000    9602.1           ' 9602 is the low-level control table for the first real event.
1950  3  5  0.000000    9602.1
1950  3  5  0.250000    9603.1           ' Note that each event except the dummy event used the 
1951  2 15  0.000000    9603.1           ' control table from the previous event for the first 15 minutes.
1951  2 15  0.250000    9604.1           
 .
 .
 .
1988  4  1  0.000000    9664.1
1988  4  1  0.250000    9665.1
1988  9 11  0.000000    9665.1
1988  9 11  0.250000    9666.1
1988  9 15 23.000000    9666.1
1925  1  1  0.000000       0.0           ' Time moving in reverse signals the end of the table!

